      "result": "{\"log\":\"PilotA played Plains\\n[Chat] PilotB: The Trebuchet is holding the line for now. Those Kids are troublesome.\\nPilotB blocked Glider Kids with Fire Navy Trebuchet\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotA cast Kyoshi Warriors\\nPilotB turn 4:\\nPilotB drew a card\\n[Chat] PilotB: Your board is getting wide quickly. Trebuchet has some defending to do.\\nPilotB played Airship Engine Room\\n[Chat] PilotB: Your board developed quickly. Time to get some air defense online.\\nPilotB cast Iguana Parrot\\n[Chat] PilotB: Your Allies are getting quite a crowd. Hoping this trebuchet can hold the line.\\nPilotA turn 5:\\nPilotA drew Swamp\\nPilotA played Swamp\\n[Chat] PilotB: That is a solid curve of creatures. Trebuchet has some defensive work to do.\\nPilotB blocked Kyoshi Warriors with Fire Navy Trebuchet\\n[Chat] PilotB: That Trebuchet is working overtime on defense.\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotA cast Kyoshi Warriors\\nPilotB turn 5:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB played Island\\n[Chat] PilotB: That\\u0026#39;s a lot of Warriors. I\\u0026#39;ll try to keep up in the air.\\nPilotB cast Swampsnare Trap\\n[Chat] PilotB: Those Warriors built quite an army. At least the skies are clear now.\\nPilotB cast Iguana Parrot\\n[Chat] PilotB: The parrots are taking to the skies. Your ground army is getting wide!\\n[Chat] PilotB: Those Warriors are building quite an army. Hoping the parrots can keep the skies clear.\\nPilotA lost 3 life\\nPilotA lost 2 life\\nPilotB sacrificed Ballistic Boulder\\nPilotA turn 6:\\nPilotA drew Plains\\nPilotA played Plains\\n[Chat] PilotA: Those parrots are annoying — time to go wide before they peck me to death!\\n[Chat] PilotA: Those parrots are annoying \\u0026mdash; time to go wide before they peck me to death!\\n[Chat] PilotB: Wide indeed! At least the parrots get to pull double duty on defense.\\nPilotB blocked Kyoshi Warriors with Fire Navy Trebuchet\\nPilotB blocked Ally Token with Iguana Parrot\\nPilotB blocked Ally Token with Iguana Parrot\\n[Chat] PilotB: Those Warriors are putting on pressure. My parrots have some work to do!\\nPilotB lost 2 life\\nPilotB lost 3 life\\nAlly Token was destroyed (PilotA)\\nAlly Token was destroyed (PilotA)\\nPilotA cast Glider Staff\\nPilotA activated Glider Staff\\u0027s ability\\nPilotB turn 6:\\nPilotB drew a card\\nPilotB cast Lost Days\\n[Chat] PilotB: Those Warriors have put me under real pressure. The parrots are keeping me in this.\\n[Chat] PilotB: The parrots are keeping this close. That Glider Staff was a big tempo swing.\\nPilotA lost 3 life\\nPilotA lost 3 life\\nPilotA turn 7:\\nPilotA drew Epic Downfall\",\"total_length\":3581,\"truncated\":true,\"cursor\":112}",
