My best line seems to be playing my land for full mana, killing a Parrot with Epic Downfall, then equipping the Staff to Warriors to make it a 4/4 flier and swinging with both creatures. Since either Parrot dies in combat against my equipped Warriors or Deserters, they likely won't block, taking 6 damage down to 1 — setting up lethal next turn — though I need to weigh how much damage they'll deal back to me in the meantime with their remaining flier.\n\
