      "reasoning": null,
      "thinking": "Opponent's tapped out with only 2 mana available, giving them three possible blockers: Inspector, Trebuchet (reach only), and a sick-but-blocking Hei Bai. If I swing with all three of my attackers, Trebuchet has to take the flyer, Hei Bai handles the Deserters, and Inspector picks up the small Ally.\n\
\n\
Instead I equip Staff onto Deserters, giving me two fliers - Warriors and now-flying Deserters - since Trebuchet is their only reach blocker, one flier gets through for lethal. With 8 lands available I can easily afford the equip cost, so I'll do that and swing with both fliers plus the token.\n\
\n\
