      "reasoning": null,
      "thinking": "My Trebuchet traded off blocking Warriors, dropping opponent to 2 life, but now they have Hei Bai at 5/5 and Inspector 1/1 with menace threatening me at 4 life. Next turn Hei Bai could hit for 7 if they sacrifice Inspector, so I need to think about how my board of Deserters, Poxbearers, the ally token, and an untapped Warriors can hold the line.\n\
\n\
Deserters can block Hei Bai while the token and Poxbearers double-block the menace Inspector, or Warriors can eat Hei Bai instead. I should move the equipped staff from Warriors, which already flies naturally, over to Deserters to make it a 3/4 flier — setting up two fliers for lethal next turn.\n\
\n\
